<title>HONG KONG: ACME Landis 1996 net down 31.1 percent.</title>
<headline>ACME Landis 1996 net down 31.1 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.6	 vs 8.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.5	 vs 3.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.07 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    8.96	vs 13.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		     243.01    vs 329.62</p>
<p>    Company name		 ACME Landis Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 19-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 11</p>
<p>NOTE - ACME Landis distributes bathroom fittings and tyres.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of an investment property.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 4.8 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.3 cents) vs 5.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
